---
import { workerBrief } from "../../data/how-i-work";
---
<aside class="how-brief" aria-labelledby="worker-brief-title">
  <div class="how-brief__intro">
    <span>example worker contract</span>
    <h3 id="worker-brief-title">A worker should not need the coordinator's chat history.</h3>
    <p>The brief carries the boundary into the worktree: observable outcome, writable paths, acceptance, exact verification and the handoff format.</p>
  </div>
  <dl class="how-brief__fields">
    {workerBrief.map(([label, value]) => (
      <div><dt>{label}</dt><dd>{value}</dd></div>
    ))}
  </dl>
</aside>
